# NOTE: models/*.pt, models/*.sha256, and models/*.sig are intentionally
# tracked, not ignored -- a previous pass here ignored them as "repo
# bloat," but they're tiny (the two current models are ~7KB/~99KB
# combined) and the whole pipeline requires them to exist on a fresh
# checkout: tests load them, the Dockerfile bakes them into the image,
# and CI's integrity-verification step needs their .sha256 alongside
# them. Untracking them broke exactly that on the next clean CI run.
